    <textTemplates>
        <name>emailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;    &lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iafc.org/images/default-source/branding/iafc_letterhead.png&quot; alt=&quot;IAFC Logo&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!LastModifiedDate}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 69, 124);&quot;&gt;{!TargetContact.FirstName} {!TargetContact.LastName}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    {!TargetContact.Title}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    {!TargetContact.Account.Name}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    {!TargetContact.MailingStreet}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    {!TargetContact.MailingCity}, {!TargetContact.MailingStateCode} {!TargetContact.MailingPostalCode}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dear {!TargetContact.Title} {!TargetContact.LastName},&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    I am pleased to appoint you to a three-year term as a member of the &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 69, 124);&quot;&gt;International Association of Fire Chiefs (IAFC)&lt;/span&gt; {!Get_Community_Group.Name}. Your term in office begins immediately and concludes at the end of the Fire-Rescue International (FRI) Conference 2029.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    The IAFC Board of Directors is extremely grateful for members like you who care deeply about our mission and are willing to accept additional responsibilities in an already busy schedule. We appreciate your readiness to provide your time, knowledge, and commitment to the IAFC.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    The work of this committee is vital in maintaining our position as leaders and experts on &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 69, 124);&quot;&gt;{!Get_Community_Group.Name}&lt;/span&gt;, and its impact on fire and emergency services and public safety. The IAFC Board of Directors relies on this committee to inform and advise us as necessary. Congratulations on being selected for this important appointment.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; The IAFC Board of Directors joins me in thanking you for taking on this new role and for your future service to this committee.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    Fire Chief Trisha Lynn Wolford&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;    IAFC President and Board Chair&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;</text>
